Serve the bundled local CRUD dashboard

Usage:
  cron-person dashboard [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help       help for dashboard
      --port int   Local dashboard port
                   (0 chooses an
                   available port)
                   (default 8080)

Global Flags:
      --config string
        Path to custom configuration
        file (default:
        $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
      --store string
        Path to custom authorization
        state file (default:
        $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
